        "id": 1329118
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-27T00:55:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The history was EC set 1 to VDO[bit26], but we set Modal_Operation_Supported_SOP\u003d0 in VIF.\n\nAnd according to VIF(Vendor Info File Specification: version 3.20), This field shall be set to the value of Type_C_Is_Alt_Mode_Adapter.\n\nIn VIF spec, If Type_C_Can_Act_As_Device is not set to YES, then this field shall be set to NO.\n\nAfter Type_C_Can_Act_As_Device be set to 1, the Data_Capable_as_USB_Device_SOP will auto-set to 1.\n\nIf Data_Capable_as_USB_Device_SOP is 1, the tester will check if EC return VDO[bit30]\u003d1 which match to VIF.",
      "parentUuid": "720b9ba2_272c55ac",
      "revId": "7927e70d3a0142dda6f529a7ba8346322f92fe27",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
